<h2>Why do Gulf buyers pay almost the same per kilo, and Bangladesh far less?</h2>
<p>Because the Gulf buys one kind of cardamom and Bangladesh another. Dividing the WITS/UN Comtrade 2024 values by tonnage:</p>
